Game-derived files (installer/mod/assets)
-----------------------------------------
The optional "awards mod" consists of loose files that IL-2 Sturmovik: Korea
reads in place of its own archives when modifications are enabled:

  * awards.cfg / awards.stock.cfg  — the game's award definitions with the
    corrections and additions described in README.md (text, derived from
    the game's own file);
  * awards.xaml, ranks.xaml         — resource dictionaries mapping artwork;
  * Awards6xx.dds, Awards6xx2.dds, Ranks5xx.dds, Ranks6xx.dds — texture
    atlases that contain the game's original decoration and rank-insignia
    artwork, extended with additional tiles drawn for this mod;
  * *.locale=*.json, *.locale=*.txt — names and descriptions, partly the
    game's own strings and partly written for this mod, in six languages.

The original artwork and text in those files are the property of the
developers and publisher of IL-2 Sturmovik: Korea and are reproduced here
solely so that the mod can be installed into a legitimately owned copy of
the game. They are not licensed for any other use. If the rights holder
objects to their presence in this repository, they will be removed.

The application itself ships no game content: at runtime it reads the
artwork, names and descriptions it displays from the user's own
installation.

